From 6605679fb9068dea55fc811d6e49000c7563dee8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:58:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fix attach button icon: theme colour and larger size

.attach-btn had no color, so currentColor resolved to black. Use --muted / --accent on hover, font-size 1.6rem.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PYWF5DEBkW3yKS3tvDRXHL
---
 CHANGES.md                            | 3 +++
 pyggie/home/templates/home/index.html | 5 +++--
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CHANGES.md b/CHANGES.md
index b1f9658..ff496d4 100644
--- a/CHANGES.md
+++ b/CHANGES.md
@@ -1,5 +1,8 @@
 # Clank.r changes — this patch (agent: Perplexity Computer session, 2026-10-24)
 
+> **Attach-icon fix (Claude, 2026-10-28)**: `.attach-btn` set no `color`, so its `currentColor` icon fell back to the
+> browser's black button text. It now uses `var(--muted)` (hover `var(--accent)`) and is larger (font-size 1.1rem → 1.6rem).
+
 > **Icon fix (Claude, 2026-10-28)** — `home/templates/home/index.html`, `home/static/icons/`.
 > SVG Repo icons shipped with hardcoded `fill/stroke="#000"` and `width/height="800px"`, so they were black
 > and mis-sized. 1. `cleanIcon()` (run in `loadIcons`) strips the XML prolog/comments/title, the fixed
diff --git a/pyggie/home/templates/home/index.html b/pyggie/home/templates/home/index.html
index 46adcf5..5321c37 100644
--- a/pyggie/home/templates/home/index.html
+++ b/pyggie/home/templates/home/index.html
@@ -544,8 +544,9 @@
       margin-bottom: 0;
     }
 
-    .attach-btn {background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:1.1rem;opacity:.7;padding:0 .4rem}
-    .attach-btn:hover {opacity:1}
+    .attach-btn {background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--muted);padding:0 .4rem;
+                 display:inline-flex;align-items:center;transition:color .15s}
+    .attach-btn:hover {color:var(--accent)}
     .file-chips {display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin-bottom:.4rem}
     .file-chips span {font-size:.75rem;border:1px solid rgba(128,128,128,.5);border-radius:999px;padding:.1rem .6rem;cursor:pointer}
     .file-chips span:hover {text-decoration:line-through}
